{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"筛余极限"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"筛余极限"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>筛余极限 (sifted colimit) 是以"},{"Local":{"url":"筛范畴","text":"筛范畴"}},{"Plain":"为指标范畴的"},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯对象","text":"单纯"}},{"Plain":"图表的"},{"Local":{"url":"几何实现(单纯图表的余极限)","text":"几何实现"}},{"Plain":"是筛余极限.</p>\n<p>任何"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":" $A$ 都是有限集合的筛余极限:\n$$\r\nA = \\operatorname{colim}_{(S\\to A)\\in\\mathsf{Fin}_{/A}} S.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}